{"Categories":[10],"HiddenTopics":[],"Topics":[1,33,34],"Id":40,"TextResource":{"Name":"deliport","Translations":[{"Text":"Deliport","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Deliport","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":35},{"FloorId":"3","Id":128}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>DELIPORT es un empresa familiar con locales en el aeropuerto hace 28 años, actualmente  con ropa y accesorios de mujer exclusivos, traídos de Paris e Italia, con una línea de foulard diseños exclusivos nuestros, te invitamos a visitar nuestros locales, te sorprenderás !<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Specially dedicated to knitwear and fabrics, Deliport offers a wide range of traditional products such as scarves, caps, cardigans, and bags, as well as specially selected souvenirs to serve as a cozy reminder of Chile.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916772","Updated":"1489712587","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/040_deliport.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/393\/node\/311","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/393\/node\/311","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/040_deliport.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/40\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/040_deliport.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/40\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_shop_phone"},{"key":"field_shop_site_internet","label":"Website","field_name":"field_shop_site_internet"},{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_shop_openinghours"}]},"HasAdditionalInfo":true}